cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use lppack in research, please cite this software release and the
  relevant Ladderpath publication.
title: "lppack: Ladderpath Python Toolkit"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "ecsLab"
abstract: >-
  A Python toolkit for discovering nested hierarchical structure in sequences
  and representing it as a standard Ladderpath JSON object.
version: 3.0.0
date-released: "2026-09-02"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/yuernestliu/lppack"
url: "https://github.com/yuernestliu/lppack"
keywords:
  - ladderpath
  - hierarchy
  - sequence analysis
  - compression
  - phylogeny

